  "question": {
    "text": "A line passing through the point <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> encloses an area of <math><mn>4</mn></math> sq. units with coordinate axes. The distance (in units) of the origin from the line is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
